    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "This card's effect reduces the digivolution cost by 2, and the total digivolution cost reduction when combined with BT3-103 [Hidden Potential Discovered!]   is 7.",
        "question": "I used BT3-103 [Hidden Potential Discovered!],   then I played this card.  I then used this card's [On Play] [When Digivolving] effect to suspend 1 other Digimon.  If I use BT3-103 [Hidden Potential Discovered!]'s   effect to suspend one of my Digimon other than this card when I use the part of the effect after \"then\" to digivolve this card, how much is the digivolution cost reduced by this card's effect?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
  },
